nts\\ui\\input-group.tsx\nsrc\\components\\ui\\label.tsx\nsrc\\components\\ui\\sonner.tsx\nsrc\\components\\ui\\textarea.tsx\nsrc\\schemas\\auth.ts\nsrc\\types\\supabase.ts\nsrc\\actions\\auth.ts\nsrc\\app\\(auth)\\login\\page.tsx\nsrc\\app\\(auth)\\register\\page.tsx\nsrc\\app\\page.tsx\nsrc\\components\\auth\\login-form.tsx\nsrc\\components\\auth\\logout-btn.tsx\nsrc\\components\\auth\\signup-form.tsx\nsrc\\components\\ui\\checkbox.tsx\nsrc\\lib\\db\\queries.ts\nsrc\\lib\\supabase\\client.ts\nsrc\\lib\\supabase\\middleware.ts\nsrc\\lib\\supabase\\server.ts"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "call_0fb6f9041dc54a8aa52fde90", "content": "No files found"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "call_185ca67f8ae74b5281f1b1b7", "content": "No files found"}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": ", I can see the project structure. It's a Next.js 16 app with App Router. It has:\n- Authentication pages (login, register, forgot password, confirm email)\n- Admin and applicant dashboards\n- UI components (using Radix UI and shadcn pattern)\n- Database queries with Drizzle ORM\n- Supabase client/server helpers\n- Schemas (Zod validations)\n- Actions (server actions)\n\nThis is a moderately complex web application. Let me check a few key files to understand the testing challenges and opportunities.\n\n"}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_c70f5ed57c524eb6b87f6f83", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "c:\\Users\\ADMIN\\Desktop\\workspace\\projects\\Special-Resident-Retiree-s-Visa\\src\\lib\\db\\queries.ts"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_2b305677882547bead22f9e3", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "c:\\Users\\ADMIN\\Desktop\\workspace\\projects\\Special-Resident-Retiree-s-Visa\\src\\actions\\auth.ts"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_4fc59c17bb6346d7a49f55df", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "c:\\Users\\ADMIN\\Desktop\\workspace\\projects\\Special-Resident-Retiree-s-Visa\\src\\schemas\\auth.ts"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "call_f8c2e667b6724a5e994e5cac", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "c:\\Users\\ADMIN\\Desktop\\workspace\\projects\\Special-Resident-Retiree-s-Visa\\README.md"}}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "call_f8c2e667b6724a5e994e5cac", "content": "1\t# Special Resident Retiree's Visa (SRRV) Service Platform\n2\t\n3\tA web-based platform designed to help foreign retirees apply for and manage their **Special Resident Retiree's Visa (SRRV)** services online.\n4\t\n5\tThe platform streamlines the entire application process by providing a centralized portal where applicants can create accounts, submit applications, upload required documents, track application progress, receive updates, and complete online payments.\n6\t\n7\tAn administrative portal is also provided for staff to review applications, manage applicant records, monitor payments, and update application statuses.\n8\t\n9\t## Features\n10\t\n11\t### Public Features\n12\t\n13\t* SRRV Information Pages\n14\t* Service & Package Listings\n15\t* Pricing Information\n16\t* Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\n17\t* Contact Page\n18\t* User Registration & Login\n19\t\n20\t### Applicant Features\n21\t\n22\t* Secure Account Registration & Authentication\n23\t* SRRV Application Submission\n24\t* Document Upload & Management\n25\t* Application Status Tracking\n26\t* Payment Processing\n27\t* Profile Management\n28\t* Support & Inquiry System\n29\t* Notification Updates\n30\t\n31\t### Admin Features\n32\t\n33\t* Applicant Management\n34\t* Document Review & Verification\n35\t* Application Approval Workflow\n36\t* Status Management\n37\t* Payment Monitoring\n38\t* Dashboard Analytics\n39\t* Service & Package Management\n40\t\n41\t## Technology Stack\n42\t\n43\t### Frontend\n44\t\n45\t* Next.js\n46\t* TypeScript\n47\t* Tailwind CSS\n48\t* Shadcn/UI\n49\t\n50\t### Backend\n51\t\n52\t* Next.js Server Actions\n53\t* Next.js API Routes\n54\t\n55\t### Database & Authentication\n56\t\n57\t* Supabase PostgreSQL\n58\t* Supabase Auth\n59\t\n60\t### File Storage\n61\t\n62\t* Supabase Storage\n63\t\n64\t### Payments\n65\t\n66\t* Xendit Hosted Checkout\n67\t\n68\t### Deployment\n69\t\n70\t* Vercel\n71\t\n72\t## Repository\n73\t\n74\t```bash\n75\tgit clone https://github.com/XjorLml/Special-Resident-Retiree-s-Visa.git\n76\t\n77\tcd Special-Resident-Retiree-s-Visa\n78\t```\n79\t\n80\t## Installation\n81\t\n82\t### Prerequisites\n83\t\n84\t* Node.js 20+\n85\t* PNPM\n86\t* Supabase Project\n87\t\n88\t### Install Dependencies\n89\t\n90\t```bash\n91\tpnpm install\n92\t```\n93\t\n94\t### Configure Environment Variables\n95\t\n96\tCopy the example file:\n97\t\n98\t```bash\n99\tcp env.copy.example .env.local\n100\t```\n101\t\n102\tConfigure your Supabase credentials:\n103\t\n104\t```env\n105\tNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=\n106\tNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=\n107\tSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=\n108\t```\n109\t\n110\t## Development\n111\t\n112\tRun the development server:\n113\t\n114\t```bash\n115\tpnpm dev\n116\t```\n117\t\n118\tOpen:\n119\t\n120\t```text\n121\thttp://localhost:3000\n122\t```\n123\t\n124\t## Production Build\n125\t\n126\tBuild the application:\n127\t\n128\t```bash\n129\tpnpm build\n130\t```\n131\t\n132\tStart the production server:\n133\t\n134\t```bash\n135\tpnpm start\n136\t```\n137\t\n138\t## Linting\n139\t\n140\t```bash\n141\tpnpm lint\n142\t```\n143\t\n144\t## Application Workflow\n145\t\n146\t1. Applicant creates an account.\n147\t2. Applicant verifies email address.\n148\t3. Applicant purchases an SRRV service package.\n149\t4. Applicant completes the application form.\n150\t5. Applicant uploads required documents.\n151\t6. Admin reviews submitted information.\n152\t7. Application status is updated throughout the process.\n153\t8. Applicant receives notifications and updates.\n154\t9. Application proceeds until approval or completion.\n155\t\n156\t## Future Enhancements\n157\t\n158\t* Real-time notifications\n159\t* Chatbot integration\n160\t* Revenue analytics\n161\t* Application conversion tracking\n162\t* Multi-language support\n163\t* Advanced reporting dashboard\n164\t\n165\t## License\n166\t\n167\tThis project is intended for SRRV service management and application processing.\n168\t\n169\tPlease consult the project owner before redistribution or commercial use.\n170\t"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "call_2b305677882547bead22f9e3", "content": "1\t'use server'\n2\t\n3\timport { redirect } from 'next/navigation'\n4\timport { revalidatePath } from 'next/cache'\n5\timport { createClient } from '@/lib/supabase/server'\n6\timport type { Provider } from '@supabase/supabase-js'\n7\t\n8\timport {\n9\t  loginSchema,\n10\t  registerSchema,\n11\t  type LoginInput,\n12\t  type RegisterInput,\n13\t} from '@/schemas/auth'\n14\t\n15\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n16\t// TYPES\n17\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n18\t\n19\texport type ActionResult =\n20\t  | { success: true; message?: string }\n21\t  | { success: false; error: string }\n22\t\n23\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n24\t// LOGIN\n25\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n26\t\n27\texport async function loginAction(input: LoginInput): Promise<ActionResult> {\n28\t  const parsed = loginSchema.safeParse(input)\n29\t  if (!parsed.success) {\n30\t    return { success: false, error: parsed.error.issues[0].message }\n31\t  }\n32\t\n33\t  const supabase = await createClient()\n34\t\n35\t  const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({\n36\t    email: parsed.data.email,\n37\t    password: parsed.data.password,\n38\t  })\n39\t\n40\t  if (error) {\n41\t    return { success: false, error: error.message }\n42\t  }\n43\t\n44\t  const role = data.user?.user_metadata?.role as string | undefined\n45\t\n46\t  revalidatePath('/', 'layout')\n47\t\n48\t  if (role === 'admin') redirect('/admin/dashboard')\n49\t  if (role === 'applicant') redirect('/applicant/dashboard')\n50\t\n51\t  redirect('/')\n52\t}\n53\t\n54\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n55\t// REGISTER\n56\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n57\t\n58\texport async function registerAction(input: RegisterInput): Promise<ActionResult> {\n59\t  const parsed = registerSchema.safeParse(input)\n60\t  if (!parsed.success) {\n61\t    return { success: false, error: parsed.error.issues[0].message }\n62\t  }\n63\t\n64\t  const supabase = await createClient()\n65\t\n66\t  const capitalize = (str: string) => str.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + str.slice(1).toLowerCase();\n67\t\n68\t  const firstName = capitalize(parsed.data?.firstName);\n69\t  const surname = capitalize(parsed.data?.surname);\n70\t  const fullName = `${firstName} ${surname}`; // capitalize first leetter and combine firsname and lastname \n71\t  console.log(fullName)\n72\t  console.log(parsed.data.email)\n73\t  console.log(parsed.data.birthday)\n74\t\n75\t\n76\t  const { data, error: signUpError } = await supabase.auth.signUp({\n77\t    email: parsed.data.email.toLowerCase(),\n78\t    password: parsed.data.password,\n79\t    options: {\n80\t      data: {\n81\t      name: fullName,\n82\t      sex: parsed.data.sex,\n83\t      birthday: parsed.data.birthday,\n84\t      nationality: parsed.data.nationality,\n85\t      age: 25,\n86\t      address: parsed.data.address,\n87\t      },\n88\t    },\n89\t  })\n90\t\n91\t  if (signUpError) {\n92\t    console.error('signup error:', signUpError)\n93\t    return { success: false, error: signUpError.message }\n94\t  }\n95\t\n96\t  if (!data.user) {\n97\t    return { success: false, error: 'Failed to create account. Please try again.' }\n98\t  }\n99\t\n100\t  if(data.user && !data.session) {\n101\t    console.error('A confirmation email has been sent. Please verify your email before logging in.')\n102\t    return { success: false, error: 'A confirmation email has been sent. Please verify your email before logging in.'}\n103\t  }\n104\t\n105\t  // ! no need to manual insert bcoz of options and triggers \n106\t  // const { error: profileError } = await supabase\n107\t  //   .from('client_profiles')\n108\t  //   .insert({\n109\t  //     user_id: data.user.id,\n110\t  //     name: fullName,\n111\t  //     sex: parsed.data.sex,\n112\t  //     birthday: parsed.data.birthday,\n113\t  //     nationality: parsed.data.nationality,\n114\t  //     age: parsed.data.age,\n115\t  //     address: parsed.data.address,\n116\t  //   })\n117\t\n118\t  // if (profileError) {\n119\t  //   console.error('Profile insert error:', profileError) \n120\t  //   return { success: false, error: profileError.message }\n121\t  // }\n122\t\n123\t  revalidatePath('/', 'layout')\n124\t  redirect('/confirm-email')\n125\t}\n126\t\n127\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n128\t// LOGOUT\n129\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n130\t\n131\texport async function logoutAction(): Promise<void> {\n132\t  const supabase = await createClient()\n133\t  await supabase.auth.signOut()\n134\t  revalidatePath('/', 'layout')\n135\t  redirect('/login')\n136\t}\n137\t\n138\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n139\t// FORGOT PASSWORD\n140\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n141\t\n142\texport async function forgotPasswordAction(email: string): Promise<ActionResult> {\n143\t  if (!email || !email.includes('@')) {\n144\t    return { success: false, error: 'Please enter a valid email address.' }\n145\t  }\n146\t\n147\t  const supabase = await createClient()\n148\t\n149\t  const { error } = await supabase.auth.resetPasswordForEmail(email, {\n150\t    redirectTo: `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/reset-password`,\n151\t  })\n152\t\n153\t  if (error) {\n154\t    return { success: false, error: error.message }\n155\t  }\n156\t\n157\t  return { success: true, message: 'Password reset link sent. Check your email.' }\n158\t}\n159\t\n160\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n161\t// RESET PASSWORD\n162\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n163\t\n164\texport async function resetPasswordAction(newPassword: string): Promise<ActionResult> {\n165\t  if (!newPassword || newPassword.length < 8) {\n166\t    return { success: false, error: 'Password must be at least 8 characters.' }\n167\t  }\n168\t\n169\t  const supabase = await createClient()\n170\t\n171\t  const { error } = await supabase.auth.updateUser({ password: newPassword })\n172\t\n173\t  if (error) {\n174\t    return { success: false, error: error.message }\n175\t  }\n176\t\n177\t  revalidatePath('/', 'layout')\n178\t  redirect('/login')\n179\t}\n180\t\n181\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n182\t// GET SESSION\n183\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n184\t\n185\texport async function getSession() {\n186\t  const supabase = await createClient()\n187\t  const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()\n188\t  return user\n189\t}\n190\t\n191\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n192\t// OAUTH\n193\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n194\t\n195\texport async function oauthAction(provider: Provider): Promise<ActionResult> {\n196\t  const supabase = await createClient()\n197\t\n198\t  const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({\n199\t    provider,\n200\t    options: {\n201\t      redirectTo: `${process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL}/api/auth/callback`,\n202\t    },\n203\t  })\n204\t\n205\t  if (error || !data.url) {\n206\t    return { success: false, error: error?.message ?? 'OAuth failed' }\n207\t  }\n208\t\n209\t  redirect(data.url)\n210\t}"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "call_4fc59c17bb6346d7a49f55df", "content": "1\timport { z } from 'zod'\n2\t\n3\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n4\t// LOGIN\n5\t// \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n6\t\n7\texport const loginSchema = z.object({\n8\t  email: z\n9\t    .string()\n10\t   