ns)\n\n1. **Zod Schemas** ([src/schemas/auth.ts](src/schemas/auth.ts)) - 100% pure functions\n   - Test validation rules, edge cases, refine conditions\n   - No external dependencies, instant execution\n   - Example: Test that passwords match, email format validation, required fields\n\n2. **Utility Functions** ([src/lib/utils.ts](src/lib/utils.ts))\n   - The `cn()` function (clsx + tailwind-merge) can be tested\n\n3. **Custom Hooks** ([src/hooks/use-mobile.ts](src/hooks/use-mobile.ts))\n   - Can be tested with `@testing-library/react-hooks`\n\n### **Moderately Testable** (Requires mocking)\n\n4. **Server Actions** ([src/actions/auth.ts](src/actions/auth.ts))\n   - Can mock Supabase client\n   - Test business logic, error handling, redirect logic\n   - Challenges: Next.js `redirect()` and `revalidatePath()` need mocking\n   \n5. **UI Components** (shadcn/Radix components)\n   - Test rendering, props, user interactions\n   - Need `@testing-library/react` and `jest-dom`\n   - May need to mock Radix UI primitives\n\n### **Harder to Unit Test** (Consider integration/ E2E)\n\n6. **Pages with Server Components**\n   - Heavy Next.js coupling\n   - Better suited for integration tests with Playwright\n\n7. **Supabase Integration**\n   - Best tested with test database or mocked responses\n\n---\n\n## **Recommended Testing Stack**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@testing-library/react\": \"^16.0.0\",\n    \"@testing-library/jest-dom\": \"^6.0.0\",\n    \"@testing-library/user-event\": \"^14.0.0\",\n    \"jest\": \"^29.0.0\",\n    \"jest-environment-jsdom\": \"^29.0.0\",\n    \"ts-jest\": \"^29.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"jest\",\n    \"test:watch\": \"jest --watch\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr use **Vitest** (faster, more modern):\n```json\n{\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"vitest\": \"^2.0.0\",\n    \"@testing-library/react\": \"^16.0.0\",\n    \"@testing-library/jest-dom\": \"^6.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest\",\n    \"test:ui\": \"vitest --ui\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## **Pragmatic Recommendation**\n\n**Start with what's easiest**:\n\n1. Add testing framework (Vitest recommended - faster, better DX)\n2. Write unit tests for:\n   - All Zod schemas (validate edge cases)\n   - Utility functions\n   - Pure helper functions\n3. Selectively test critical Server Actions with mocked Supabase\n4. Skip testing simple shadcn UI components (they're well-tested already)\n5. Use **Playwright** for critical user flows (login, registration, application submission)\n\nThis gives you **~60-70% coverage** on logic-heavy code with minimal maintenance burden.\n\n---\n\n**Would you like me to set up a testing framework (Vitest or Jest) and write example tests for your schemas and auth actions?**"}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-caveat>Caveat: The messages below were generated by the user while running local commands. DO NOT respond to these messages or otherwise consider them in your response unless the user explicitly asks you to.</local-command-caveat>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<command-name>/model</command-name>\n            <command-message>model</command-message>\n            <command-args>sonnet</command-args>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-stdout>Set model to claude-sonnet-4-6</local-command-stdout>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "hi"}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Provider API request failed. (request_id=req_58c931f3f328)"}], "reasoning_content": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<local-command-caveat>Caveat: The messages below were generated by the user while running local commands. DO NOT respond to these messages or otherwise consider them in your response unless the user explicitly asks you to.</local-command-caveat>\n"}, {"type": "text", "text": "<command-name>/model</command-name>\n            <command-message>model</comm